WEBVTT

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:35.196
However, the process by which grass
and fiber is broken up

00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:40.156
in the stomachs of cows
and other grazing ruminants

00:00:40.196 --> 00:00:42.956
has a byproduct, methane,

00:00:42.996 --> 00:00:45.076
a potent greenhouse gas.

00:00:46.236 --> 00:00:49.836
Despite what you might have heard
about methane and cows,

00:00:49.876 --> 00:00:52.316
most of the methane
is actually burped out,

00:00:52.356 --> 00:00:54.116
not through the back end.

00:00:54.156 --> 00:00:56.156
(Laughter)

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:59.316
And that represents
about two billion tons

00:00:59.356 --> 00:01:02.076
of carbon dioxide equivalent per year,